{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1289692-how-do-i-get-my-book-back","id":1289692,"title":"How do I get my book back?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-19T16:21:29-08:00","id":1289692,"title":"How do I get my book back?","content":"It's been just about a week since the post office refusal to deliver my book. I have gotten no response from Richard Thomas, either private message or the public comment section of Kickstarter projects. I've tried Mathew Dawkins via onyx path YouTube channel, which YouTube isn't as good on mobile for private message. That Wednesday the post office did everything in it's power to make sure I don't receive my book. Onyx path, I love supporting you guys to the best of my abilities and funds, I do understand that it's probably a honest mistake or somebody forgot my apartment number. How can we fix this situation?<br /> <br /> Last known location of my package is Knoxville TN post office.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-21T19:02:44-08:00","id":1290626,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure why you'd expect any of the people you named to be able to help? Your book is adrift somewhere in the murky waters of the USPS.<br /> <br /> As for why they didn't deliver it, in my experience USPS is the absolute worst and will make up any excus